WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.400
An AI tool can make you a website in seconds…

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.300
…but to change a price or remove a part, you need code and technical skills.

3
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.000
On Nodbusiness, your website is made of pieces you can touch. No code, ever.

4
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.600
Choose what you are building: a hotel, a shop, an office, a company…

5
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.400
Take a ready template: a full website in one tap…

6
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.000
…or start from scratch and build it piece by piece.

7
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:31.600
Tap + to add a piece: cover, rooms, photos, prices…

8
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.000
Each piece snaps into place, like a puzzle, and you see it live.

9
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.600
Tap a piece and a simple form opens. Add a photo from your phone.

10
00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:46.000
Type your name and a few words. The website changes as you type.

11
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:52.000
Add your rooms with a photo and a price. No code, no designer.

12
00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:57.900
Edit any piece, any time: a new price in seconds.

13
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.900
Move a piece up or down.

14
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.900
Delete what you no longer need.

15
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Add a new piece whenever you want. Nothing breaks.

16
00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:13.000
Pick your colour.

17
00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:17.000
It fits computer, tablet and phone by itself.

18
00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:22.400
Tap Publish: your website is live for everyone.

19
00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:25.400
Customers book and buy from your website. You decide what you sell.

20
00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:31.000
A week later? Change a photo, tap Update: live in seconds.

21
00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:38.400
A city office, a company, a kid, a grandmother…

22
00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:44.000
If you can fill a form, you can build a website.

23
00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:49.700
Elsewhere: code to change it. Here: tap, edit, sell.

24
00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:54.000
Build any part. Change it any time. Publish and sell, your way.
